## Voice

- Prefer Azure Neural TTS `en-GB-SoniaNeural` (uksouth).
- Say **adviser**, not advisor. Say **Agreement in Principle** in full, never “AIP”.
- On-screen brand **MortgageEasy**; VO may use one-word brand pronunciation where locked.
- Do not stretch with `atempo` to fit picture. Lock picture to transcribed speech.
- Do not burn captions into the MP4. Site captions are HTML/VTT, shown only while muted.

## Picture

- Native speed only. Never freeze or slow-mo talking heads.
- **Family lock:** husband = olive-brown skin, short dark curls, olive shirt over white tee. Wife = cream knit, shoulder-length brown hair. Two children in family scenes.
- MortgageEasy white tablet badge on branded live shots. Navy open/close credit uses `open-logo.png`.
- Final export: Constrained Baseline, no B-frames, stereo AAC, `+faststart`.

## Site player

- Muted autoplay on scroll into view. Captions while muted; hide when unmuted.
- End card: **Start your journey** → `#your-journey`.
